WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:04.533
Video twenty-five. Screen languages, and
phonetic typing.

00:00:04.733 --> 00:00:07.750
Ctrl+K changes the language of the screens.

00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:10.697
Ctrl+W changes the language of your typing.

00:00:10.626 --> 00:00:13.242
Your data and the keys stay the same.

00:00:13.543 --> 00:00:19.226
Ctrl+K opens the list. Hindi and Gujarati are
complete. 8 more languages are in beta.

00:00:19.256 --> 00:00:23.674
Type Hindi, and press Enter. Now every screen
is in Hindi.

00:00:26.656 --> 00:00:30.541
The keys stay the same. B still opens the
Balance Sheet.

00:00:31.621 --> 00:00:35.640
Ctrl+K again. Type Gujarati, and press Enter.

00:00:36.627 --> 00:00:40.646
Alt+Y still opens the Data menu. Your data
stays the same.

00:00:41.726 --> 00:00:46.343
A new screen language also sets the typing
language. Here we create a ledger.

00:00:47.045 --> 00:00:51.396
Type the sound of the name in English letters.
Hisaab writes it in Gujarati.

00:00:51.426 --> 00:00:55.844
Ctrl+W changes only the typing language, for
example to English.

00:00:57.592 --> 00:01:01.078
Ctrl+K and English bring back the English
screens.

00:01:03.685 --> 00:01:07.103
Work in your own language. The keys stay the
same.

00:01:07.033 --> 00:01:10.519
Next: Hisaab Docs reads a bill into a voucher.

